<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 11.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 11.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali gives instructions for an &quot;environment avenue&quot; to be created in each municipality.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President plants olive tree to mark national Tree Day.</p>
</text>
